We're Hiring in Poland!

Looking for your next challenge in Java or AI/ML? We have three exciting opportunities for experienced engineers who want to build modern, high-impact products. 🚀

📍 Location: Poland

We're currently hiring for:
🔹 Senior Java Developer
 🔹 Senior Full-Stack Java Developer
 🔹 Senior Machine Learning Engineer

🔎 What we're looking for:
Senior Java Developer
 • 5+ years of commercial Java experience;
 • Strong knowledge of Spring Boot and microservices;
 • Experience with AWS (preferred) and NoSQL databases (MongoDB is a plus);
 • Comfortable working in Agile teams and building scalable backend systems. 

Senior Full-Stack Java Developer
 • Strong Java and Spring Boot background;
 • Experience with modern frontend technologies (React or Angular);
 • Hands-on experience with REST APIs, cloud platforms and distributed systems;
 • Knowledge of Docker, Kubernetes and CI/CD practices. 

Senior Machine Learning Engineer
 • Commercial experience building Machine Learning solutions;
 • Strong Python skills and hands-on experience with LLMs and Generative AI;
 • Experience with RAG, vector databases, AI agents or modern AI frameworks;
 • AWS experience and a genuine AI-first engineering mindset. 

🚀 If you're looking for a role where you'll have real technical ownership, collaborate with experienced engineers, and work on products with global impact - we'd love to hear from you.

